---
import { getRelativeLocaleUrl } from 'astro:i18n';

import Header from '../../components/header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/footer.astro';

import '/src/styles/global.css';
import '/src/styles/about.css'

const resumeUrl = getRelativeLocaleUrl(Astro.currentLocale!, '/resume');
const projectsUrl = getRelativeLocaleUrl(Astro.currentLocale!, '/projects');

---
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		
		<script src="/src/dev/debug.ts"/>
		
		<script>
			fetch("https://www.duolingo.com/2017-06-30/users?username=Suetam0101 ", {
				signal: AbortSignal.timeout(5000),
			})
			.then((r) => r.json())
			.then((data) => {
				const elems = document.getElementsByClassName("blockJpRight");
				
				for (let index = 0; index < elems.length; index++) {
					const element = elems[index];
					element.getElementsByTagName("p")[0].textContent = data.users[0].streak + ' Days :)';
				}
			})
			.catch((e) =>{
				document.getElementsByClassName("blockJpRight")[0].getElementsByTagName("p")[0].textContent = 'Couldn\'t fetch streak :(';
			})
		</script>

		<title>Mateus Cerejo - About</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header/>
		<section id="content">
			<p id="pageTitle">プロフィール</p>
			<p id="wip">翻訳中</p>
            <p id="intro">Hello this page is for a more personal introduction, maybe what you are looking for is <a href={projectsUrl} class="bold">/projects</a> & <a href={resumeUrl} class="bold">/resume</a>.</p>
            <div id="blocks">
				<div id="imgMe" class="imgBlock">
					<img src="/me.webp" alt="picture">
				</div>
				<div id="blockIntro" class="block">
					<p>> Hello</p>
					<p>> My name you already know</p>
					<p>> But here you can find out more about me</p>
					<p>> Ideas</p>
					<p>> Projects</p>
					<p>> Hobbies</p>
					<p>> ...</p>
				</div>
				<div id="imgClouds" class="imgBlock">
					<img src="/clouds.jpg" alt="picture">
				</div>
				<div id="blockFuture" class="block">
					<p>This website is mostly an attempt at getting some extra “credits” for job interviews :D</p>
					<br>
					<p>But I do like the idea of having some sort of blog where I post about whatever I’m working on. Not so much for others to see but more of a journal or documentation for myself.</p>
					<p>I’m very open to moving to another country if it means I’ll get to work on something that interests me.</p>
					<br>
					<p>Anyway, checkout my <a class="link" href="https://monkeytype.com/profile/Sue0101" target="_blank">monkeytype profile</a>.</p>
				</div>
				<div id="imgFishing" class="imgBlock">
					<img src="/fishing.jpg" alt="picture">
				</div>
				<div id="blockJp" class="block">
					<div id="blockJpLeft">
						<p>I’m currently learning Japanese</p>
						<p>> Anki</p>
						<p>> Duolingo</p>
						<p>> Consuming Japanese media</p>
						<p>That’s all you really need</p>
					</div>
					<div class="blockJpRight">
						<img src="/duo.png" alt="duolingo">
						<p>Fetching streak o_o</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div id="blockGame" class="block">
					<p>> CSS must be fun once you know most of the techniques but until then we suffer</p>
					<p>I’m currently making a typing game :O</p>
					<p>While that game isn't out you can try out a game I made with some friends back in university</p>
					<p>> <a class="link" href="https://suetam0101.itch.io" target="_blank">LINK </a><span style="font-size: smaller;">(I don’t promise it fully works tho...)</span></p>
				</div>
				<div id="imgKeyboard" class="imgBlock">
					<img src="/key.jpg" alt="">
				</div>
				<div id="imgMedia" class="imgBlock">
					<div class="mediaColWrap">
						<div id="anime" class="mediaCol">
							<div class="topLane">
								<img src="/cowboybebop.jpg" alt="Cowboy Bebop">
								<img src="/onepiece.jpg" alt="One Piece">
								<img src="/linkclick.jpg" alt="Link Click">
							</div>
							<div class="bottomLane">
								<img src="/sonnyboy.jpg" alt="Sonny Boy">
								<img src="/steinsgate.jpg" alt="Stens;Gate">
								<img src="/azumangadaioh.jpg" alt="Azumanga Daioh">
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="mediaColWrap">
						<div id="music" class="mediaCol">
							<div class="albumCoverWrap"><img src="/worldisyours.jpg" alt="World Is Yours"></div>
							<div class="albumCoverWrap"><img src="/splittingbranches.jpg" alt="Splitting Branches"></div>
							<div class="albumCoverWrap"><img src="/shukusai.jpg" alt="Shukusai"></div>
							<div class="albumCoverWrap"><img src="/nichijoushometsu.jpg" alt="Nichijou Shometsu"></div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="mediaColWrap">
						<div id="manga" class="mediaCol">
							<div class="topLane">
								<img src="/kokounohito.jpg" alt="The Climber">
								<img src="/yotsubato.jpg" alt="Yotsuba&!">
								<img src="/onepunchman.jpg" alt="One Punch Man">
							</div>
							<div class="bottomLane">
								<img src="/windbreaker.jpg" alt="Wind Breaker (Webtoon)">
								<img src="/deathnote.jpg" alt="Death Note">
								<img src="/tokyoghoul.jpg" alt="Tokyo Ghoul">
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="mediaColWrap">
						<div id="games" class="mediaCol">
							<div id="gamesLeft">
								<div id="gamesLeft1">
									<img src="/mine.jpg" alt="Minecraft">
								</div>
								<div id="gamesLeft2">
									<img src="/rocket.jpg" alt="Rocket League">
								</div>
							</div>
							<div id="gamesRight">
								<img src="/clash.jpg" alt="Clash Royal">
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div id="block1" class="block">
					<p>That's about it</p>
					<br>
					<p>It was fun building this website</p>
					<p>I think it turned out pretty true to the original concept (simple, clean, yet personal)</p>
					<p>Don't underestimate the power of mockups</p>
					<p>With that beeing said, It will probably change over time</p>
					<p>Just like a bedroom changes throught the years</p>
					<br>
					<br>
					<div style="text-align: center;">
						<p>If you have any suggestions you can email me at</p>
						<p><a class="link" href="mailto:mateuscerejo@proton.me">mateuscerejo@proton.me</a></p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
